♪In ancient times, a meteor fell♪

00:00:22.528 --> 00:00:29.920
♪Scorching Nanba Weald into land bare♪

00:00:30.336 --> 00:00:39.993
♪From Turquoise Land beneath the sun♪

00:00:41.088 --> 00:00:52.256
♪The evil Earth Fiends were born♪

00:00:55.168 --> 00:00:58.400
♪Marching in South Mountain's domain♪

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:01.248
♪Sworn warriors raged for glory's gain♪

00:01:01.248 --> 00:01:03.328
♪Renamed guardians hold Yanguan true♪

00:01:03.328 --> 00:01:06.656
♪Peace in all lands, a priceless boon♪

00:01:12.224 --> 00:01:15.264
♪Seven hounds, two whips, one blade♪

00:01:15.264 --> 00:01:18.048
♪In rout and flight,
Earth Fiends escape♪

00:01:18.048 --> 00:01:20.839
♪Golden Gate seals fast♪

00:01:20.872 --> 00:01:25.243
♪South Mountain Hunters
on the righteous path♪

00:01:26.752 --> 00:01:37.024
♪South Mountain Hunters
on the righteous path♪

00:01:37.024 --> 00:01:41.216
=Love on the Turquoise Land=

00:01:41.216 --> 00:01:44.000
(This story is a work of fiction)

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:47.001
=Episode 11=

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:50.960
Get the door.

00:01:57.319 --> 00:01:58.119
Open up.

00:02:01.039 --> 00:02:02.039
The door is knocked off.

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:02.860
Xiong.

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:08.920
Business is picking up?

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:16.399
I found it yesterday.

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:20.599
Have you had blood drawn recently?

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:24.240
Not recently.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:26.200
The last time

00:02:26.599 --> 00:02:28.839
was during last year's
physical examination.

00:02:37.879 --> 00:02:39.999
Last night when I was sleeping,

00:02:42.879 --> 00:02:44.439
I felt it was strange.

00:02:44.999 --> 00:02:46.559
Like I was passing out.

00:02:48.559 --> 00:02:49.800
It was hazy.

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:52.040
I felt...

00:02:53.839 --> 00:02:54.920
I felt like...

00:02:58.320 --> 00:02:59.839
someone was touching me.

00:03:04.399 --> 00:03:05.439
Don't panic yet.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.879
You might've been exhausted lately

00:03:08.879 --> 00:03:09.719
and had a bad dream.

00:03:14.839 --> 00:03:15.999
Was this a dream too?

00:03:23.719 --> 00:03:25.800
If this happens again,

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:26.960
call me immediately.

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:32.520
I did call,

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:35.480
but you were busy.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:48.119
I'm sorry.

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:50.439
It was my oversight.

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:52.920
I'm sorry.

00:04:03.439 --> 00:04:04.080
Hello?

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:05.080
Well?

00:04:05.439 --> 00:04:06.679
Tell me, am I sharp or not?

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.279
I told you to leave early.

00:04:08.279 --> 00:04:08.999
Wasn't I right?

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:09.879
What's wrong?

00:04:09.879 --> 00:04:10.960
You know what?

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:13.679
Xiong Hei carried someone in.

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:16.080
He looked rushed.

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:17.200
Looks like

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:19.159
it was a real struggle for them
to nab him.

00:04:20.279 --> 00:04:22.039
No idea what that man did wrong.

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:24.560
Xiong Hei and his men
kept slapping him around.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:26.279
They wanted me
to wake him up immediately.

00:04:26.279 --> 00:04:27.560
Do you know who he is?

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:28.599
I didn't dare ask.

00:04:28.599 --> 00:04:29.640
That's not protocol.

00:04:29.839 --> 00:04:32.399
Heard them call him 'Gou' or something.

00:04:32.719 --> 00:04:33.520
Gou Ya?

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:34.440
Yes.

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:36.680
Does that even sound like a decent name?

00:04:36.839 --> 00:04:37.640
When I looked,

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:38.880
he looked like gang muscle.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:40.479
Maybe even a top enforcer.

00:04:41.039 --> 00:04:42.320
Even Xiong Hei's goons

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:43.880
got beaten to a pulp by him.

00:04:44.159 --> 00:04:45.200
Got it.

00:04:45.599 --> 00:04:46.479
Talk later.

00:05:01.839 --> 00:05:04.239
Don't let Ms. Lin find out
that you've noticed this.

00:05:08.399 --> 00:05:09.479
Keep your head down.

00:05:10.919 --> 00:05:12.000
Don't confront them.

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:16.760
Give me more time.

00:05:17.399 --> 00:05:18.719
I'll fix this.

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:21.440
Okay?

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:38.919
If he hadn't run,

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:42.880
maybe it wouldn't have come to this.

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:46.960
Should we follow protocol?

00:05:48.479 --> 00:05:49.640
Or let the group decide?

00:06:05.719 --> 00:06:07.599
Ms. Lin, you have guests?

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:10.880
Perfect, let me introduce them.

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:14.440
Who doesn't know Ms. Lin's prized jewel?

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:17.560
We can introduce ourselves.

00:06:21.599 --> 00:06:22.880
Hi, I'm Yan Tuo.

00:06:24.039 --> 00:06:24.760
Sorry,

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.399
Ms. Lin never mentioned you all.

00:06:28.719 --> 00:06:30.599
We've heard plenty
about you from Ms. Lin.

00:06:31.479 --> 00:06:33.640
Ms. Lin, playing favorites?

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.200
The one who can't speak properly

00:06:36.479 --> 00:06:37.279
is Yang Zheng.

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:40.320
Among the names we saw earlier,

00:06:40.719 --> 00:06:42.760
(Roadsound Group List)
those who are still active...

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:44.520
That woman

00:06:44.919 --> 00:06:45.760
is Li Yueying.

00:06:46.448 --> 00:06:47.839
(They are all coming to Xicang.)

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:51.359
Let me formally introduce myself.

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:52.760
Feng Mi.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:54.239
Mi as in 'honey.'

00:06:56.839 --> 00:06:57.479
Hello.

00:07:03.839 --> 00:07:05.359
That bracelet's gorgeous.

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:06.880
Where'd you get it?

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:10.960
From a client.

00:07:16.239 --> 00:07:16.919
Ms. Lin,

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.560
something's come up at work. Got to go.

00:07:19.279 --> 00:07:20.520
My treat later.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:21.799
Go ahead.

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:22.599
Okay.

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:24.560
Stay a bit longer.

00:07:26.279 --> 00:07:27.279
Got shut down, huh?

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:31.520
Ms. Lin,

00:07:32.159 --> 00:07:34.440
your eldest son's quite the character.

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:35.919
I like him.

00:07:36.279 --> 00:07:37.239
Enough.

00:07:56.599 --> 00:07:57.440
How is Gou Ya doing?

00:07:57.520 --> 00:07:59.120
Not badly hurt. He's fine.

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:01.560
Xiong Hei said they'll take him
when he wakes.

00:08:02.039 --> 00:08:05.120
He ordered his men
to prepare at some farm.

00:08:05.399 --> 00:08:06.200
Farm?

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:10.760
Lv Xian.

00:08:11.799 --> 00:08:13.640
Mr. Lv, you're my savior.

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:15.039
Help me one more time.

00:08:15.279 --> 00:08:16.919
Find any way to keep him here longer.

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:19.479
How am I supposed to do that?

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:21.640
Should I tell him,
"We haven't bonded enough

00:08:21.839 --> 00:08:23.080
and should drink and chat,"

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:24.159
when he wakes up?

00:08:24.719 --> 00:08:26.320
Why not just keep him under?

00:08:26.839 --> 00:08:27.880
This is urgent.

00:08:28.359 --> 00:08:29.839
You really need to help me again.

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:31.999
What's going on?

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:35.839
Fine.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:37.560
Then you should think carefully.

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:38.280
About what?

00:08:38.599 --> 00:08:40.280
Obviously, how to thank me properly.

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:49.479
How to keep him?

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:10.759
They've all been treated.

00:09:10.839 --> 00:09:11.759
Rest assured.

00:09:12.359 --> 00:09:13.999
Those pals are all fine too.

00:09:14.239 --> 00:09:14.999
Superficial wounds.

00:09:15.119 --> 00:09:16.080
Except these two.

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:20.599
You should've come earlier for stitches.

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:22.119
Now it's too late.

00:09:22.879 --> 00:09:23.960
Might leave a scar.

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:26.800
Your wrist needs rest to heal.

00:09:26.999 --> 00:09:29.040
Can't be helped.
Bone injuries need three months.

00:09:29.239 --> 00:09:29.879
Right?

00:09:31.119 --> 00:09:32.080
By the way, Xiong,

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:34.359
are you feeling alright?

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:38.320
It's a stupid question.

00:09:38.879 --> 00:09:40.519
You're as tough as forged iron.

00:09:42.519 --> 00:09:44.599
So go back and rest.

00:09:44.839 --> 00:09:45.999
I'll tell you when he wakes.

00:09:46.639 --> 00:09:47.280
No need.

00:09:47.839 --> 00:09:50.119
We'll take him immediately
when he wakes.

00:09:50.759 --> 00:09:52.400
At least eat something first.

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:53.680
You've been up all night.

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:55.160
Xiong,

00:09:55.479 --> 00:09:57.519
the noodle shop to the right is good.

00:09:57.776 --> 00:09:58.896
Try the green pepper noodle.

00:09:58.896 --> 00:10:00.200
Tell their owner I sent you.

00:10:00.304 --> 00:10:02.200
- You'll get extra toppings.
- Are you hungry?

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:03.080
No.

00:10:05.359 --> 00:10:06.160
No.

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:08.160
Fully dedicated to your duties.

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:09.599
Selfishly embracing the world.

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:16.519
T-Then I'll refill his IV fluids.

00:10:22.879 --> 00:10:23.719
Not hungry?

00:10:24.519 --> 00:10:26.160
Yet who ate my takeout?

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:26.879
Not hungry?

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:45.599
Xiong.

00:10:47.759 --> 00:10:48.400
What's that?

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:50.639
Medication. I'm switching it.

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:53.440
Why's the color different?

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:54.680
T-This is stronger.

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:56.800
You wanted him awake fast, right?

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:03.200
Wait.

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:05.359
W-What's with this?

00:11:05.839 --> 00:11:06.639
What are you doing?

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:12.800
Xiong, you don't trust me?

00:11:17.839 --> 00:11:18.719
Remember this.

00:11:19.519 --> 00:11:20.800
Roadsound Group helped me.

00:11:21.479 --> 00:11:22.359
Ms. Lin isn't my mom.

00:11:22.359 --> 00:11:23.160
But she raised me.

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:24.920
I know where my loyalty lies.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:26.960
All these years,

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.800
you've come through here so many times.

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:30.119
Did I ever ask questions?

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:31.680
Did I demand a single cent?

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:32.879
Why?

00:11:33.119 --> 00:11:34.519
I care about you buddies.

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:36.599
I know

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:38.400
your work's tough and thankless,

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:39.599
righteous but unseen.

00:11:39.879 --> 00:11:41.599
I understand. I feel for you.

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:43.080
But who cares about me?

00:11:44.336 --> 00:11:45.479
You keep coming here,

00:11:45.479 --> 00:11:46.439
not holding back at all.

00:11:46.439 --> 00:11:47.839
One day, you'll attract the police.

00:11:47.839 --> 00:11:49.264
What becomes of Wanbao Tower then?

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:51.719
So I wanted to use strong medicine

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:53.239
to wake him fast.

00:11:53.239 --> 00:11:54.440
So he can be taken away soon.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:55.200
For you and me,

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:56.680
and for everyone, it's good, right?

00:12:01.479 --> 00:12:02.560
You don't trust me? Fine.

00:12:03.759 --> 00:12:05.800
Let's stick to conservative treatment.

00:12:07.239 --> 00:12:08.320
Give back my fried noodles.

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:12.080
Why not use it earlier?

00:12:14.719 --> 00:12:15.759
That medicine

00:12:16.359 --> 00:12:17.920
has some side effects.

00:12:18.032 --> 00:12:19.216
It might damage his brain.

00:12:23.719 --> 00:12:25.759
He's brainless. Use it.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:27.519
Are you sure?

00:12:28.999 --> 00:12:29.960
Buy some fried noodles.

00:12:31.599 --> 00:12:32.239
Make it a large.

00:12:34.599 --> 00:12:35.400
Fine.

00:12:37.999 --> 00:12:38.680
Bro.

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:40.719
You and I have a history.

00:12:40.719 --> 00:12:41.960
After all we've been through,

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:43.560
drop the tough act.

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:44.999
Alright?

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:48.119
Xiong.

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:49.879
Hei.

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:52.119
Get back to work.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.479
You two still haven't finished?

00:13:13.479 --> 00:13:14.280
Almost done.

00:13:14.719 --> 00:13:16.320
Alright, I'll do it.

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:17.160
Come on.

00:13:17.719 --> 00:13:18.320
Unbelievable.

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:20.359
Is it shift change time?

00:13:20.719 --> 00:13:21.479
Not yet.

00:13:22.759 --> 00:13:24.479
What? Am I early?

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:26.160
Then you continue.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:26.999
No.

00:13:27.239 --> 00:13:28.320
You've already started.

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:29.040
Not my shift yet.

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:30.479
You take over. I'm leaving.

00:13:30.479 --> 00:13:30.999
Wait.

00:13:30.999 --> 00:13:32.920
- Let's go.
- You two... I...

00:13:33.759 --> 00:13:35.359
How utterly shameless.

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:37.080
Unbelievable.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:38.719
What...

00:14:57.760 --> 00:14:58.960
(Lv Xian)

00:15:00.528 --> 00:15:02.639
(Lv Xian)

00:15:02.639 --> 00:15:04.048
(Gou Ya is unnatural.)

00:15:04.048 --> 00:15:05.519
(I gave strong meds. But he woke.)

00:15:05.519 --> 00:15:06.639
(Xiong Hei took him away.)

00:15:16.839 --> 00:15:17.839
Do you think Ms. Lin

00:15:17.879 --> 00:15:19.359
will spare Gou Ya's life?

00:15:20.119 --> 00:15:22.560
Why keep him? Let him bite you later?

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:33.296
(Roadsound Group)

00:17:35.728 --> 00:17:38.768
(Roadsound Group, Lin Xirou)

00:17:55.568 --> 00:17:57.328
(Clue Map)

00:17:58.928 --> 00:18:04.080
(Clue Map)

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:14.239
You actually found him.

00:18:36.368 --> 00:18:38.864
(Humanoid Earth Fiends)

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:46.608
(Lin Xirou, Be Substituted, Xiong Hei,
Created Earth Fiend, Attacker, Human)

00:18:46.608 --> 00:18:52.656
(Primal Earth Fiend,
Humanoid Earth Fiend)

00:19:03.632 --> 00:19:04.976
(Mr. Changxi)

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:22.600
Ms. Lin.

00:19:27.319 --> 00:19:27.960
Xiong.

00:19:34.799 --> 00:19:35.559
Ms. Lin,

00:19:37.719 --> 00:19:38.479
I was wrong.

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:40.799
Gou Ya...

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:43.559
Gou Ya was wrong.

00:19:45.719 --> 00:19:47.440
Gou Ya was wrong.

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:52.799
Ms. Lin, his mistakes

00:19:53.279 --> 00:19:54.519
deserve multiple deaths.

00:19:55.319 --> 00:19:56.920
But with our current shortage,

00:19:57.600 --> 00:19:58.519
keeping him

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:02.200
even as experimental material
to improve root removal...

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:12.360
If it were just occasional omnivory,

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:13.840
maybe we could spare him.

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:17.039
But fleeing recklessly
and nearly exposing us

00:20:17.719 --> 00:20:20.440
endangered all of us.

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:23.920
We're already on thin ice.

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:26.440
There's no room for error.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:30.279
My bottom line is absolute.

00:20:31.519 --> 00:20:32.999
It's crossed by no human

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:35.719
and defied by no kin.

00:21:10.079 --> 00:21:11.319
He's to be executed.

00:21:11.999 --> 00:21:13.239
Is this necessary?

00:21:13.999 --> 00:21:15.279
Baring fangs at Ms. Lin

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:17.424
is intolerable.

00:21:17.424 --> 00:21:18.512
(Mr. Changxi: It's me. Are you okay?)

00:21:18.512 --> 00:21:19.400
Exactly.

00:21:19.559 --> 00:21:21.519
(It's me. Are you okay?)
Baring fangs at kin is taboo.

00:21:22.079 --> 00:21:23.319
Especially toward Ms. Lin.

00:21:34.239 --> 00:21:34.960
Prepare.

00:22:05.712 --> 00:22:06.800
(Inbox, Tuo)

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:08.799
(Watching Gou Ya's execution.)

00:22:08.999 --> 00:22:10.519
Gou Ya?

00:22:11.216 --> 00:22:12.752
(Reply)

00:22:12.752 --> 00:22:16.156
(Compose)

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:19.239
(Be careful.)

00:22:25.279 --> 00:22:27.799
(Text me when you're safe.)

00:22:31.056 --> 00:22:34.480
(Sending to Tuo)

00:22:34.480 --> 00:22:35.024
(Sent)

00:24:12.880 --> 00:24:14.960
It's our first time executing a kin.

00:24:15.960 --> 00:24:18.360
Hope it's also the last.

00:25:23.600 --> 00:25:24.999
With the internal threat resolved,

00:25:25.440 --> 00:25:26.680
it's time for external ones.

00:25:28.960 --> 00:25:30.680
How's Jiang Baichuan's situation?

00:25:31.600 --> 00:25:33.600
Xiong Hei says he's being pampered,

00:25:34.279 --> 00:25:36.799
turning Rare Stone Garden
into his personal home.

00:25:45.680 --> 00:25:49.840
(Entrusted by All, Aid from All Sides)

00:25:52.519 --> 00:25:53.719
Need something? Speak up.

00:25:53.920 --> 00:25:55.319
You think we'd lock you up?

00:25:55.519 --> 00:25:56.600
Leaving without a word?

00:25:56.600 --> 00:25:57.559
Why is that?

00:25:57.960 --> 00:25:59.440
I haven't had time to explain.

00:25:59.519 --> 00:26:01.319
The train departs in two hours.

00:26:01.400 --> 00:26:02.600
'Haven't had time'?

00:26:03.479 --> 00:26:05.440
I'd never seen an Earth Fiend before.

00:26:05.680 --> 00:26:06.479
I wasn't scared.

00:26:06.999 --> 00:26:07.799
Now,

00:26:09.200 --> 00:26:10.960
with so many
humanoid Earth Fiends out there,

00:26:11.559 --> 00:26:12.600
can we tell them apart?

00:26:13.719 --> 00:26:14.600
Even Shen

00:26:15.360 --> 00:26:17.200
secretly kept
a live Earth Fiend at the base.

00:26:18.239 --> 00:26:18.999
Tell me,

00:26:19.559 --> 00:26:20.440
shouldn't I be scared?

00:26:21.039 --> 00:26:21.960
I'm scared.

00:26:22.640 --> 00:26:23.680
I fear death.

00:26:24.319 --> 00:26:25.920
I fear my wife and my kids losing me

00:26:25.920 --> 00:26:27.239
and my parents having to bury me.

00:26:28.279 --> 00:26:29.079
Working with you,

00:26:29.999 --> 00:26:30.960
it doesn't feel safe.

00:26:35.999 --> 00:26:37.079
Anyone else leaving?

00:26:56.680 --> 00:26:57.680
Anyone?

00:26:59.200 --> 00:27:00.120
Speak up now.

00:27:31.880 --> 00:27:32.920
Sorry, Big Head.

00:27:38.600 --> 00:27:39.400
Any others?

00:28:27.799 --> 00:28:30.759
Names once etched in fiend bones
are now burned to be sealed.

00:28:32.160 --> 00:28:35.479
Leaving South Mountain behind,
no more fellowship remains.

00:29:05.920 --> 00:29:06.864
The Ghost Whip cracks.

00:29:07.719 --> 00:29:08.559
Fiend bones tremble.

00:29:09.120 --> 00:29:11.160
You're the Ghost Whip, Yu Rong?

00:29:12.640 --> 00:29:13.680
You're back.

00:29:13.680 --> 00:29:15.160
Shen, we've got a chance.

00:29:16.160 --> 00:29:18.160
Sorry, who are you?

00:29:18.559 --> 00:29:19.920
No one else leaving?

00:29:21.519 --> 00:29:22.960
We'll introduce each other later.

00:29:24.680 --> 00:29:25.400
Burn the bones.

00:29:26.799 --> 00:29:27.600
Open the cauldron.

00:30:45.640 --> 00:30:47.039
Stealing the Whip Clan's job?

00:30:47.519 --> 00:30:48.999
Now you're secretly taming a fiend.

00:30:51.999 --> 00:30:53.559
I've replicated 70% to 80%

00:30:55.360 --> 00:30:57.120
of the Earth Fiends'
communication frequency.

00:30:58.920 --> 00:31:00.279
With proper training,

00:31:01.640 --> 00:31:03.999
it could become our ultimate weapon.

00:31:11.719 --> 00:31:13.279
True, certain acoustic devices exist

00:31:13.999 --> 00:31:16.680
to drive away protected marine species

00:31:16.680 --> 00:31:17.600
and mammals.

00:31:18.880 --> 00:31:19.759
But

00:31:22.680 --> 00:31:24.519
we're far from fully controlling them

00:31:25.239 --> 00:31:26.799
or communicating

00:31:27.880 --> 00:31:28.799
with them.

00:31:30.160 --> 00:31:30.960
Earth Fiends

00:31:32.319 --> 00:31:33.880
aren't like trained seals

00:31:34.079 --> 00:31:35.759
at an aquarium,

00:31:36.840 --> 00:31:38.440
clapping on command

00:31:38.880 --> 00:31:40.559
or balancing balls.

00:31:48.519 --> 00:31:50.160
Whether to keep that Earth Fiend

00:31:51.840 --> 00:31:53.319
can be put to a vote.

00:31:58.600 --> 00:31:59.999
I vote to keep it.

00:32:03.920 --> 00:32:06.120
To let it go, where could it go?

00:32:08.239 --> 00:32:08.999
To keep it,

00:32:09.880 --> 00:32:11.680
here's the safest place.

00:32:13.880 --> 00:32:17.239
Our priority is rescuing Jiang.

00:32:19.559 --> 00:32:20.999
I have no time for that thing.

00:32:50.704 --> 00:32:53.744
(Wanbao Tower)

00:33:04.319 --> 00:33:07.039
Can't you see the sign says 'Closed'?

00:33:07.640 --> 00:33:08.559
Come back tomorrow.

00:33:18.120 --> 00:33:19.039
Open up.

00:33:21.120 --> 00:33:23.600
I wondered who'd be so clueless.

00:33:26.680 --> 00:33:27.840
What's your act now?

00:33:32.039 --> 00:33:33.279
I keep asking for favors,

00:33:33.279 --> 00:33:34.600
so I came to repay the debt.

00:33:35.640 --> 00:33:37.160
As Wanbao Tower's esteemed owner,

00:33:37.239 --> 00:33:38.519
shouldn't you dress sharply

00:33:38.519 --> 00:33:39.440
and presentably?

00:33:40.279 --> 00:33:41.079
Impossible.

00:33:41.999 --> 00:33:43.479
From the out-of-season discount rack?

00:33:43.920 --> 00:33:44.759
Or gifts from someone

00:33:44.759 --> 00:33:46.440
in the wrong size? My gain then.

00:33:47.200 --> 00:33:48.200
Don't want them?

00:33:48.200 --> 00:33:49.920
Fine, I'll take them back.

00:33:50.519 --> 00:33:51.559
Put them down.

00:34:00.400 --> 00:34:02.519
After careful consideration,

00:34:04.160 --> 00:34:05.440
you're up to no good.

00:34:07.880 --> 00:34:09.720
As your sworn brother
from another mother,

00:34:09.720 --> 00:34:10.960
I feel for you.

00:34:11.119 --> 00:34:12.240
I can't bear seeing you rot

00:34:12.240 --> 00:34:14.039
in this gloomy shack all day.

00:34:14.800 --> 00:34:16.920
So change into these new clothes

00:34:17.039 --> 00:34:19.199
and join me for some hiking.

00:34:21.720 --> 00:34:22.519
No way.

00:34:25.199 --> 00:34:25.999
No way.

00:34:26.800 --> 00:34:27.479
Wait.

00:34:27.559 --> 00:34:29.519
Wearing such expensive clothes
for hiking?

00:34:29.800 --> 00:34:30.639
You've lost it.

00:34:31.800 --> 00:34:32.720
Actually, fair point.

00:34:33.880 --> 00:34:35.559
I brought something more practical.

00:34:39.360 --> 00:34:40.679
If I return it, is it still mine?

00:34:54.920 --> 00:34:56.240
This isn't meant for me, is it?

00:34:58.280 --> 00:34:59.720
A deal is a deal.

00:35:10.800 --> 00:35:11.440
We're here.

00:35:17.360 --> 00:35:18.840
Master Wang, please.

00:35:23.960 --> 00:35:25.880
Hurry up, or should I drag you?

00:35:26.240 --> 00:35:27.360
Commit to the act fully.

00:35:29.039 --> 00:35:29.800
Here we go.

00:35:29.800 --> 00:35:30.840
Marvel at this.

00:35:31.960 --> 00:35:32.800
Master Wang.

00:35:33.559 --> 00:35:36.079
My humble collectibles

00:35:36.079 --> 00:35:37.440
are displayed inside.

00:35:37.960 --> 00:35:40.920
I've never really appreciated
those intricately crafted gold, silver,

00:35:40.920 --> 00:35:42.519
and jade ornaments.

00:35:43.519 --> 00:35:44.360
Elegant.

00:35:45.039 --> 00:35:45.679
Very elegant.

00:35:48.840 --> 00:35:51.360
Having your esteemed presence

00:35:51.400 --> 00:35:53.639
truly brings radiance
to our modest venue.

00:35:53.840 --> 00:35:54.440
You flatter me.

00:35:54.440 --> 00:35:56.199
Please help me with your expert opinion.

00:35:56.199 --> 00:35:57.240
Of course.

00:35:57.320 --> 00:35:58.039
After you.

00:35:58.320 --> 00:35:59.400
Hello, Mr. Yan.

00:36:00.280 --> 00:36:02.119
Ms. Lin previously said

00:36:02.639 --> 00:36:03.559
the Rare Stone Garden

00:36:03.559 --> 00:36:05.400
won't be open to outsiders for now.

00:36:05.920 --> 00:36:06.679
To outsiders?

00:36:06.720 --> 00:36:07.679
Who is the 'outsider'?

00:36:07.679 --> 00:36:08.880
Me or Master Wang?

00:36:08.920 --> 00:36:09.479
Step aside...

00:36:09.760 --> 00:36:10.720
Yan,

00:36:11.240 --> 00:36:13.679
all matters
require proper timing and affinity.

00:36:14.000 --> 00:36:15.960
If today is not the day,
we can try another day.

00:36:16.800 --> 00:36:18.960
Actually, I have dinner plans tonight...

00:36:22.800 --> 00:36:23.639
Such great patina.

00:36:24.679 --> 00:36:26.199
With important clients and executives.

00:36:26.440 --> 00:36:27.519
I should go get ready now.

00:36:27.519 --> 00:36:28.479
It's about time anyway.

00:36:28.479 --> 00:36:29.519
No.

00:36:29.519 --> 00:36:30.400
Master Wang.

00:36:30.400 --> 00:36:31.479
Please wait a moment.

00:36:31.479 --> 00:36:32.559
My apologies.

00:36:35.760 --> 00:36:36.920
What's wrong with you?

00:36:39.280 --> 00:36:40.519
He's a notable guest for us.

00:36:40.519 --> 00:36:42.199
Yanguan Province's urban plan
was designed

00:36:42.199 --> 00:36:43.479
using his feng shui.

00:36:44.240 --> 00:36:45.639
Do you know how much effort it took

00:36:46.280 --> 00:36:48.199
to invite him
to inspect our Rare Stone Garden?

00:36:49.079 --> 00:36:50.559
But it's closed to outsiders now.

00:36:51.960 --> 00:36:53.400
Let me report this.

00:36:53.400 --> 00:36:54.320
To whom?

00:36:54.320 --> 00:36:55.440
I'm the General Manager.

00:36:55.440 --> 00:36:56.599
Who will you report to?

00:36:57.079 --> 00:36:57.800
Listen.

00:36:58.119 --> 00:36:59.280
If you mess this up today,

00:36:59.280 --> 00:37:00.320
I'll skin you alive.

00:37:00.639 --> 00:37:01.440
Treat him properly.

00:37:01.599 --> 00:37:02.280
Now.

00:37:03.440 --> 00:37:04.479
Master Wang.

00:37:04.720 --> 00:37:05.360
Come on.

00:37:05.360 --> 00:37:06.119
Master.

00:37:06.119 --> 00:37:06.760
After you.

00:37:06.760 --> 00:37:08.159
My apologies. Just a minor hiccup.

00:37:08.159 --> 00:37:09.232
- Right.
- Not forcing you?

00:37:09.232 --> 00:37:09.760
Not at all.

00:37:09.760 --> 00:37:11.519
What are you talking about?

00:37:11.920 --> 00:37:13.440
Please come inside.

00:37:13.440 --> 00:37:15.240
As you can see,
this is our Rare Stone Garden.

00:37:15.240 --> 00:37:16.599
Master Wang, what should

00:37:16.760 --> 00:37:18.159
my mom be cautious about?

00:37:20.400 --> 00:37:22.400
Don't all parents say,

00:37:23.079 --> 00:37:25.320
"Your wings have hardened,
and you no longer listen"?

00:37:25.840 --> 00:37:26.999
So the root cause

00:37:27.360 --> 00:37:28.639
lies in the wings.

00:37:28.880 --> 00:37:29.639
The wings?

00:37:29.880 --> 00:37:32.240
Make your mom believe
your wings aren't fully developed

00:37:32.240 --> 00:37:33.599
and you can't fly far yet.

00:37:34.079 --> 00:37:35.639
This will ease her mind.

00:37:36.760 --> 00:37:38.039
How to achieve this?

00:37:38.800 --> 00:37:40.079
She must avoid certain foods.

00:37:40.920 --> 00:37:41.559
Certain foods?

00:37:41.679 --> 00:37:43.280
Avoid anything with wings.

00:37:44.119 --> 00:37:45.400
Like chickens and geese.

00:37:47.720 --> 00:37:48.599
Well...

00:37:49.800 --> 00:37:50.400
Quail.

00:37:50.639 --> 00:37:51.440
Quail.

00:37:51.840 --> 00:37:52.639
Ducks.

00:37:54.360 --> 00:37:56.760
Cicadas, butterflies.

00:37:56.760 --> 00:37:57.800
She can't have those.

00:37:58.240 --> 00:37:58.920
That makes sense.

00:37:59.240 --> 00:38:00.440
But my mom is a vegetarian.

00:38:00.920 --> 00:38:02.240
Master, please come in.

00:38:04.656 --> 00:38:06.159
Of course I know she's a vegetarian.

00:38:06.760 --> 00:38:08.280
I was testing you.

00:38:09.559 --> 00:38:10.280
Never mind.

00:38:11.119 --> 00:38:12.960
Let me consult the hexagrams
for your mom

00:38:13.360 --> 00:38:14.599
and create a dietary plan

00:38:15.159 --> 00:38:16.599
to ensure absolute safety.

00:38:18.280 --> 00:38:19.559
Excellent, Master Wang.

00:38:25.840 --> 00:38:26.599
Master Wang,

00:38:26.599 --> 00:38:27.800
this way, please.

00:38:28.320 --> 00:38:29.800
Troubling.

00:38:30.760 --> 00:38:31.720
What's wrong?

00:38:32.199 --> 00:38:33.199
Don't scare me like that.

00:38:34.320 --> 00:38:36.519
I rushed out this morning

00:38:37.039 --> 00:38:38.199
and didn't cast a hexagram.

00:38:38.880 --> 00:38:41.920
But getting angry just now
made me realize today is auspicious

00:38:42.039 --> 00:38:43.920
for travel, weddings, and construction.

00:38:43.920 --> 00:38:45.079
Everything's good to go,

00:38:45.119 --> 00:38:47.999
just can't slip up.

00:38:47.999 --> 00:38:49.199
What does that mean?

00:38:50.119 --> 00:38:51.039
Can't have

00:38:52.199 --> 00:38:53.880
slip-up lions.

00:38:56.079 --> 00:38:57.199
Master Wang?

00:38:57.360 --> 00:38:59.039
What did you say to him?

00:38:59.039 --> 00:38:59.679
What happened?

00:38:59.679 --> 00:39:00.479
Nothing.

00:39:00.479 --> 00:39:01.519
We talked about my mom.

00:39:01.519 --> 00:39:02.920
Then he suddenly became like this.

00:39:02.960 --> 00:39:03.760
Right.

00:39:04.159 --> 00:39:05.199
It's... It's Mom

00:39:06.039 --> 00:39:07.039
Oh, my God.

00:39:07.760 --> 00:39:08.800
From ancient times,

00:39:09.320 --> 00:39:12.920
my great-grandmother is calling me.

00:39:14.760 --> 00:39:16.039
Take care of him.

00:39:16.039 --> 00:39:16.960
I'll get help.

00:39:18.519 --> 00:39:20.280
You, come here and help.

00:39:20.280 --> 00:39:21.400
Hurry up.

00:39:21.760 --> 00:39:22.840
Help him.

00:39:23.199 --> 00:39:24.119
Press his philtrum.

00:39:24.400 --> 00:39:25.800
Check his pockets for medicine.

00:39:25.800 --> 00:39:26.920
I'll call an ambulance.

00:39:27.800 --> 00:39:28.639
Take care of him.

00:39:40.880 --> 00:39:42.920
Any chance for a change in the menu?

00:39:43.599 --> 00:39:45.240
Make the dough softer.

00:39:45.240 --> 00:39:46.999
Who uses unleavened dough
for steamed buns?

00:39:47.479 --> 00:39:48.159
Jiang Baichuan.

00:39:55.480 --> 00:39:57.400
What? You're interested in this too?

00:39:57.640 --> 00:39:58.720
Very interested.

00:40:00.600 --> 00:40:02.560
Then you should thank Mr. Yan.

00:40:03.480 --> 00:40:04.000
Mr. Yan.

00:40:04.000 --> 00:40:05.080
Please come in.

00:40:05.080 --> 00:40:05.920
You're Zhang, right?

00:40:06.120 --> 00:40:06.920
Yes.

00:40:07.360 --> 00:40:08.800
After eating your mulberries,

00:40:09.120 --> 00:40:10.400
let me give you some advice.

00:40:10.680 --> 00:40:12.880
Lean closer. I have some wisdom for you.

00:40:13.120 --> 00:40:14.080
Yes, Master Wang?

00:40:15.280 --> 00:40:18.160
Judging from your facial features,

00:40:21.840 --> 00:40:23.760
tell your mom
to watch her digestive health.

00:40:25.200 --> 00:40:26.640
You can tell my mom's

00:40:26.760 --> 00:40:28.280
health condition from my face?

00:40:28.280 --> 00:40:29.040
Of course.

00:40:29.760 --> 00:40:32.120
Longing is a mysterious thing.

00:40:33.080 --> 00:40:34.560
Your mom's concern for you

00:40:34.920 --> 00:40:36.440
is like an invisible hand,

00:40:36.640 --> 00:40:38.120
following you everywhere.

00:40:38.400 --> 00:40:39.640
It rests on your shoulders,

00:40:39.720 --> 00:40:40.920
weighs on your chest,

00:40:41.120 --> 00:40:43.120
and manifests in your complexion.

00:40:44.640 --> 00:40:46.200
Please continue, Master Wang.

00:40:46.600 --> 00:40:47.480
I'm all ears.

00:40:47.536 --> 00:40:51.856
♪If we don't retreat,
we'll go through it together♪

00:40:51.856 --> 00:40:56.176
♪Heaven-forged fire
lights up the endless night♪

00:40:56.240 --> 00:41:00.440
♪Ripping apart the hidden truth
beneath the surface♪

00:41:00.440 --> 00:41:04.800
♪Heaven-sent tides can't
drown this stubborn flame♪

00:41:04.872 --> 00:41:12.640
♪Farewell to the old times,
and scenes fade away one by one♪

00:41:32.160 --> 00:41:36.520
♪The shapeless fire
clings to matter to illuminate♪

00:41:36.520 --> 00:41:40.840
♪Yet malice in darkness
defies the flame's pursuit♪

00:41:40.840 --> 00:41:45.280
♪A noble name must do righteous deeds♪

00:41:45.280 --> 00:41:47.720
♪After sunrise,
even wise words falter in truth♪

00:41:47.720 --> 00:41:51.800
♪Heaven-forged fire
scorches flesh and bone♪

00:41:51.800 --> 00:41:56.160
♪Dig out the truth buried
beneath the earth♪

00:41:56.160 --> 00:42:00.520
♪Heaven-sent tides can't
quench this reckless fire♪

00:42:00.520 --> 00:42:04.880
♪If we don't retreat,
we'll go through it together♪

00:42:04.880 --> 00:42:09.240
♪Heaven-kindled flames are different♪

00:42:09.240 --> 00:42:13.520
♪Truth's madness is hiding
under the surface♪

00:42:13.520 --> 00:42:18.080
♪The large waves are rolling
towards the sky♪

00:42:18.080 --> 00:42:25.800
♪Farewell to the old times,
and scenes fade away one by one♪